SUMMARY:District PAC Cookout
DESCRIPTION:District PAC Cookout \n\nDate: Wednesday\, July 29\nTime: 5:30–7:30 p.m.\nLocation: Wickersham Elementary School | 401 N Reservoir St\, Lancaster\, PA 17602\nParking: Please park behind the building and enter through the doors at the rear of the building.\n\nInterested in learning more about District PAC (Parent/Family Advisory Committee)? \nCome enjoy dinner\, meet other district families\, and learn more about District PAC and ways to get involved. District PAC provides families with opportunities to connect\, share feedback\, and partner with the district to support student success. Childcare\, interpretation\, and fun activities for children will be provided. We hope you’ll join us! We hope to see you there. \n  \nQuestions? Contact Lindsay Gregg\, Manager of Community and Family Engagement: lrgregg@sdlancaster.org
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/district-pac-cookout/
LOCATION:Wickersham Elementary\, 401 North Reservoir Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Districtwide Events
END:VEVENT
